In the spoilers is a list giving the order of preferences used by any
monster or pet to wield weapons.  It's a great list because it tells
how good the base damage of every type of weaspon.  Monsters and pets
basically ignore that a weapon may be an artifact, don't try to guess
at +/- ratings, don't try to guess at b/u/c ratings, and if they are
given a better weapon class they'll try to switch to it.  Unless the
weapon they are currently wielding is welded to their hands or if it
is twohanded and they are wearing a shield.

The list is *very* informative on what weapons to try early in the
game when you don't have any artifacts yet.  Combine that list with
what your class skill limits are, and you know which weapon in your
stash is best as soon as you know their b/u/c status.

So if your pet accidentally picks up your blessed +7 Greyswandir,
hand it a dwarvish mattock.  It'll switch.

